    <title>Example variants</title>
    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The same example in several languages.</para>
<para><anchor id="variants_1sample_ex"/><anchor id="variants_1sample_ex-C"/>C source code: <programlisting filename=".C"><codeline><highlight class="normal">demo_widget*<sp/>w<sp/>=<sp/>demo_make_widget();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">demo_resize(w,<sp/>3,<sp/>4);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> <anchor id="variants_1sample_ex-Fortran"/>Fortran source code: <programlisting filename=".f"><codeline><highlight class="normal">w<sp/>=<sp/>make_widget()</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">call<sp/></highlight><highlight class="normal">w%resize(3,<sp/>4)</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>A second group, from files.</para>
<para><anchor id="variants_1sample_inc"/><anchor id="variants_1sample_inc-C"/>C++ source code: <programlisting filename="example.cpp"><codeline><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Builds<sp/>a<sp/>widget<sp/>and<sp/>resizes<sp/>it.</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="preprocessor">#include<sp/>&quot;<ref refid="widget_8hpp" kindref="compound">demo/widget.hpp</ref>&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">int</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>main()<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><ref refid="classdemo_1_1Widget" kindref="compound">demo::Widget</ref>*<sp/>w<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="classdemo_1_1Widget_1a3b3d3a64a2128b4ab2259848749fae2c" kindref="member">demo::make_widget</ref>();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>w-&gt;<ref refid="classdemo_1_1Widget_1ab22d0f24e83705f3bb0a847888da84cd" kindref="member">resize</ref>(3,<sp/>4);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">return</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> <anchor id="variants_1sample_inc-Fortran"/>Fortran source code: <programlisting filename="example.f90"><codeline><highlight class="comment">!<sp/>Builds<sp/>a<sp/>widget<sp/>and<sp/>resizes<sp/>it.</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">program</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>main</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">use<sp/></highlight><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="namespacedemo" kindref="compound">demo</ref></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">type</highlight><highlight class="normal">(widget)<sp/>::<sp/>w</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>w<sp/>=<sp/>make_widget()</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">call<sp/></highlight><highlight class="normal">w%resize(3,<sp/>4)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">end<sp/>program<sp/></highlight><highlight class="normal">main</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>A group in a list:</para>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Step one.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Step two, in two languages. <anchor id="variants_1sample_item"/><anchor id="variants_1sample_item-C"/> C source code: <programlisting filename=".C"><codeline><highlight class="normal">demo_resize(w,<sp/>3,<sp/>4);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> <anchor id="variants_1sample_item-Fortran"/> Fortran source code: <programlisting filename=".f"><codeline><highlight class="keyword">call<sp/></highlight><highlight class="normal">w%resize(3,<sp/>4)</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Step three.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
